[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8161.069, "timestamp": "02:16:01", "text": "你好，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8163.589, "timestamp": "02:16:03", "text": "T：你好。你好。哦，谢谢你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8166.629, "timestamp": "02:16:06", "text": "也算是赞美。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8168.47, "timestamp": "02:16:08", "text": "那么，你的设计灵感来自哪里呢？我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8171.51, "timestamp": "02:16:11", "text": "挖到了。它非常……非常朋克，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8174.229, "timestamp": "02:16:14", "text": "非常哥特朋克风格。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8178.55, "timestamp": "02:16:18", "text": "呃，这个，呃，我想，呃，这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8182.189, "timestamp": "02:16:22", "text": "实际上，它的灵感来源于我的第一个……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8186.95, "timestamp": "02:16:26", "text": "运动混搭的初步概念设计。嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8189.83, "timestamp": "02:16:29", "text": "我正在研发一个新的。嗯，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8192.709, "timestamp": "02:16:32", "text": "是的，这个就是我想要的那种感觉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8197.509, "timestamp": "02:16:37", "text": "成为一个很酷的人……呃，我不知道。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8200.07, "timestamp": "02:16:40", "text": "最初是耳环之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8203.629, "timestamp": "02:16:43", "text": "因为我想变得更酷。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8206.95, "timestamp": "02:16:46", "text": "酷，因为我注意到有些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8209.669, "timestamp": "02:16:49", "text": "那些有耳洞和耳环的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8212.79, "timestamp": "02:16:52", "text": "东西看起来很酷。所以我就想，好吧，我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8215.15, "timestamp": "02:16:55", "text": "加上这些。但我是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8218.629, "timestamp": "02:16:58", "text": "星座。我是一颗星座。"}]